68885695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25bc STYLE AND STORY COLLIDE \u25bc</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2615 <strong>Upgraded Visuals:</strong> Dive into a vibrant world of New Retro animation inspired by classic \u201890s cartoons and anime</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f <strong>Fully Voiced Drama:</strong> Every scene comes alive with expressive voice acting and dynamic cutscenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Expanded Narrative:</strong> Explore a deeper, more emotional story exploring connection, identity, and family amid the neon storm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25bc COFFEE-FUELED COMBAT \u25bc</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summon &amp; Stun:</strong> Unleash new enemy-stunning summons for crowd-control flair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dream Time 2.0:</strong> An upgraded action bar integrates your Dream Time system for seamless rhythm-combat flow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Color-Switching Foes:</strong> Adapt fast to enemies that shift hues\u2014and strategies\u2014on the fly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Black &amp; White Variants:</strong> New enemies that force precise timing and tactical balance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195370/extras/c48fe3bb1ac72982621859683c109923.poster.avif?t=1768885695\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195370/extras/c48fe3bb1ac72982621859683c109923.webm?t=1768885695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195370/extras/c48fe3bb1ac72982621859683c109923.mp4?t=1768885695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25bc GROOVE THROUGH THE CHAOS \u25bc</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6Every encounter in <i>PopSlinger Vol. 2 \u2013 Loveless</i> moves to the beat.\ud83c\udfb6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>expanded, reactive soundtrack</strong> fuses <i>Future Funk, French House, Rave,</i> and <i>Pop Punk</i>, dynamically syncing to your performance\u2014every blast, dodge, and summon turns combat into a living remix.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong>shrine-like baseball stadiums</strong> to <strong>Thunderdome-esque kingdoms</strong>, each stage bursts with color, challenge, and New Retro attitude\u2014wilder, louder, and flashier than ever.\u00a0\ud83d\udca5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195370/extras/a81607eba945528dac6daaff657f410c.avif?t=1768885695\" width=1138 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In <i>PopSlinger Vol. 2 \u2013 Loveless</i>, enemies don\u2019t just fall \u2014 they <i>pop</i> to the beat!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your coffee blaster to hit enemies with the <strong>matching color</strong> to keep the rhythm alive.<br>\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Land 4 shots of the same color</strong> to trigger <strong>Akane Access!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195370/extras/d50b000a2870987e3a5500e6db4b1703.webp?t=1768885695\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195370/extras/d50b000a2870987e3a5500e6db4b1703.poster.avif?t=1768885695\" class=\"bb_img\" width=560 height=194 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Pop 8 enemies in two matching sets</strong> to create a <strong>Color Combo!</strong> \u2014 this makes the <i>music change</i> and the world around you pulse in sync.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195370/extras/bc622e17a333de2a7bd5de29a8ee1180.webp?t=1768885695\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195370/extras/bc622e17a333de2a7bd5de29a8ee1180.poster.avif?t=1768885695\" class=\"bb_img\" width=425 height=257 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the chain going!<br>\u2615 <strong>8 of the same color = Double Combo!</strong><br>\ud83c\udf08 <strong>Stack combos</strong> to charge your <strong>Special Bar</strong>, light it up, and unleash <strong>Dream Time!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more combos you pull off, the better the <strong>grooves</strong> \u2014 and your <strong>Rankman Level</strong> \u2014 will climb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195370/extras/24f4c690dfe6ef021954f851c4c9eed4.avif?t=1768885695\" width=425 height=257 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcab <i>Your flow determines the ending\u2026 and the ultimate remix of your destiny.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PopSlinger Vol. 2 \u2013 Loveless</strong> is your ticket to a <strong>funky, coffee-powered adventure like no other!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2615 <strong>Developed by Funky Can Creative \u2014 Creators of PopSlinger (2022)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["Funky Can Creative"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steams